  (315, 318, 'David Sanchez', 'Hosted by David Sanchez, a Long Beach-based community builder and real estate agent with Living CA Realty. From paddleboarding and hiking to beach cleanups, happy hours, and more, David creates fun, welcoming events that connect people across LA and OC.Let’s build a community together!Learn more atwww.YourRealtorDavid.com', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
