  (325, 328, 'TLo the Realtor', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (326, 329, 'Laura Malec', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (327, 330, 'Resabal is a management consulting firm that specializes in futureproofing.', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (328, 331, 'Shanghai Pub Crawl', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (329, 332, 'DR Libby Nugent', 'Clinical Psychologist and a `Group Work Practitioner of Group Analysis.I have particular interest in depth psychology - both Jungian and Group Analytic.The workshops I run often are exploring stories and myths in groups as a way to creatively connect and examine individual and collective psychology; providing a choice of teaching spaces, seminars and groups where people can reflect on life.The reflective spaces I provide can be either “here-and-now” events where participants study what is going on in the moment, paying particular attention to unconscious dynamics and looking at the group-as-a-whole, rather than intrapersonal or interpersonal dynamics. Or events, where the group is invited to reflect on their experiences regarding a particular piece of material: such as a group discussion on a piece of literature, or, a participant sharing a work situation to be thought about together as a group.It is not unusual that learning is transformational in terms of how participants look at themselves, their roles, their groups, and organisations they are part of.These reflective spaces are for anyone wanting to experience in action how through the group‘s discussion, meeting our reactions, our connection to symbols, imagery and association along the way, we might enable each other to better understand ourselves, each other and some of the personal and collective stories we all live.Unless explicitly stated for a specific event, no particular background or experience is necessary to participate.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (330, 333, 'Artisté Training & Events', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (331, 334, 'The Savvy PM Architect', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (332, 335, 'Martin Franco', 'Visual Arts Teacher working independently on online art classes since 2020 when I had to shut down my studio. In 2023 I started teaching a series of Drawing and Painting Classes on Zoom in English which I call "WAYS TO DRAW AND PAINT"- (WTDP) . We study diverse subjects as still lifes, landscapes, animals, portraits and the whole human figure and also we work and experiment with different materials (graphite, charcoal, watercolors, colored pencils, pastels, tempera-gouache, oil, acrylics, collage and more). Usually these are stand alone classes, some others are weekly courses. I never repeat the classes contents and they are never pre-recorded. These classes in the English language are intended mostly for beginning and intermediate students, otherwise it is announced as for advanced students. Usually we are very few in each session, so you can ask questions and show your work on camera to get some feedback and continue to improve and grow as an artist. Contact me at <dibujofranco> gmail / instagram / facebook / blogspot', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (333, 336, 'David Benkof', 'David Benkof, the Broadway Maven, has been teaching Broadway and American Jewish Culture online for five years. He aims to help students see the third time things they did not notice the first. His love for Broadway is triply expressed: his classes; his Youtube Channel; and MARQUEE: The Broadway Maven''s Weekly Blast substack newsletter. For more information, visit TheBroadwayMaven.com', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (334, 337, 'Santa Barbara Cottage Hospital Childbirth Education', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (335, 338, 'Teshia & Co.', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (336, 339, 'The Center for Men''s Excellence', 'The Center for Men''s Excellence- Psychological Services for: Men | Couples | Fathers | Families | Childrenmenexcel.comVirtual dad''s classes are open to anyone, no matter where you live!In-person dad''s classes available in San Diego, CAPsychological services available virtually to any resident of California, and in-person in San Diego, CA', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (337, 340, 'Sundial Centre for Education on Harmful Practices', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (338, 341, 'Ash Shukla', 'Click here to subscribe to our text messages.We host several high-end events throughout the year. Our promise: We produce high content events for entrepreneurs and business owners. Our events are well attended by holistic-minded business owners & women entrepreneurs who want to remove financial blockages, improve their lives, and build a business they can enjoy...', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (339, 342, 'Lane County Family Mediation', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (340, 343, 'Linda Mendonsa, Astrology Learners Academy', 'Linda Mendonsa, Director of Astrology Learners Academy, shares her 40-plus years of experience with modern Western astrology and her positive philosophy of life with you. She has been teaching astrology for over 7 years, guiding students all over the world to read their charts with confidence. Linda is known for her friendly and engaging teaching style, making the layered complexity of astrology easy to learn and apply to your own life. Come join her for this fun astrology beginner class! Learn more: https://astrologylearners.com/', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (341, 344, 'Voice Coaches CVDG', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (342, 345, 'Ellen Britton Guitar', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (343, 346, 'University Maryland Extension/JenniferDixonCravens', 'University programs, activities, and facilities are available to all without regard to race, color, sex, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, marital status, age, national origin, political affiliation, physical or mental disability, religion, protected veteran status, genetic information, personal appearance, or any other legally protected class.If you need special assistance to participate in this program, please contact the University of Maryland Extension office at least 2 weeks in advance.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (346, 349, 'UC Master Food Preserver Online Delivery Program', 'The UC Master Food Preserver Online Delivery Program offers free, research-based classes on safe home food preservation. Our trained volunteers demonstrate approved recipes and techniques for canning, freezing, drying, fermenting, and more. We hope these classes help Californians (and participants everywhere) enjoy seasonal foods year-round.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (347, 350, 'Canasta Consultant', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (348, 351, 'SkillSource TD', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00');
INSERT INTO "public"."organizers" ("id", "user_id", "display_name", "description", "logo_url", "status", "review_note", "applied_at", "approved_at", "approved_by", "created_at") VALUES
  (349, 352, 'Age UK Devon', 'Age UK Devonis a local charity working across the county to support people over 50 to live healthier, happier and more connected lives. From practical advice and wellbeing support to social groups and community programmes, we’re here to help older people stay independent and feel part of something.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (350, 353, 'The Centre for International Sustainable Development Law (CISDL)', 'The CISDL is an independent international legal research institute integrating environment, human rights and economy through legal scholarship and empowerment. Our mission is to promote legal education relating to sustainable societies and the protection of ecosystems by advancing the understanding, development and implementation of international sustainable development law. Through its various programs and initiatives, the CISDL has positioned itself as one of the world’s leading organizations dedicated to sustainable development and as the world’s leading sustainable development law charity.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (351, 354, 'Asma Khalil', 'Professor of Maternal Fetal Medicine', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (352, 355, 'Botanic Gardens Conservation International', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (353, 356, 'Thriving Autistic CLG', 'Thriving Autistic is an international non-profit, social enterprise run by Autistic and otherwise neurodivergent mental health professionals (therapists, coaches and psychologists).O﻿ur goal is to promote and protect the human rights of Autistic and Neurodivergent people.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (354, 357, 'The ManKind Project UK & Ireland', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (355, 358, 'Money Guiders England Community Network', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (356, 359, 'Dani Bacon', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (357, 360, 'The National Archives', 'The National Archivesis the official archive and publisher for the UK government, and for England and Wales. We are the guardians of some of our most iconic national documents, dating back over 1,000 years.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (358, 361, 'Packt Publishing Limited', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (359, 362, 'Centre for Comparative Literature', 'The Goldsmiths Research Centre for Comparative Literature (CCL) is an interdepartmental Centre drawing from the Department of English & Creative Writing (formerly English & Comparative Literature) and the Department of Theatre and Performance, with contributions and collaborations across Goldsmiths and beyond.Building on an established tradition of teaching and researching literary, visual, cultural and performance texts from all areas of the world and in many different languages, the CCL aims to foster innovative research in and on the theory, practice and history of comparative literature, world literature(s) and theatre, reception of the classics, multilingualism and translation, intercultural theatre, and creative writing.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (360, 363, 'Tergar Edinburgh', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (361, 364, 'Twinkl TeachMeet', 'JoinTwinkl TeachMeetfor live CPD events featuring expert-led sessions on the latest teaching strategies and resources. Our events are the perfect opportunity to boost your skills and connect with fellow educators!Learn, Connect, and Grow with Twinkl TeachMeet', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (362, 365, 'WOMCY - LATAM Women in Cybersecurity', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (363, 366, 'RECLA', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (364, 367, 'Quality Leadership University', 'Quality Leadership University fue fundada en 1997 bajo el liderazgo del Rector Oscar León, quien tuvo la visión de ofrecer el más alto nivel académico en Panamá con el objetivo de preparar líderes y profesionales que contribuyan al desarrollo de la región. A la fecha, más de 5,000 Panameños y extranjeros de todas partes del mundo han recibido sus diplomas en licenciatura y maestría en diversas áreas profesionales. Con más de 1500 estudiantes matriculados cada año en nuestros programas de Licenciaturas y Maestrías, así como en nuestros programas de Inglés para el Éxito Profesional y Educación Ejecutiva.Quality Leadership University mantiene acuerdos académicos con universidades reconocidas mundialmente como University of Louisville, Illinois State University, University of South Florida y la Universidad de Chile.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (365, 368, 'Miedo a los Aviones', 'M﻿iedo a los Aviones ofrece cursos por streaming y online (autoguiados) para personas que aun no volaron o que lo hacen pero con mucha ansiedad o miedo.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (366, 369, 'Grandes Pymes - Consultoría y Capacitación', 'Consultora especializada en Direccion y Gestion de Pequeñas y Medianas Empresas.Sabemos de Pymes y podemos ayudarte!', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (367, 370, 'Centro de Formación Profesional', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (368, 371, 'Bolsa de Comercio de Santa Fe', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (369, 372, 'ABS International', 'ABS International es una empresa dedicada a la capacitación desde el año 1993.Somos organizadores del Congreso Internacional para Docentes y Directivos de Inglés y del Congreso Internacional para Directivos de Instituciones Educativas, entre otros talleres y congresos de educación.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (370, 373, 'Prevencion y Movimiento', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (371, 374, 'DRA GRACIELA FERRARO', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (372, 375, 'Centro Argentino de Cartografía', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (375, 378, 'NSW Institute of Trauma and Injury Management', 'The NSW Institute of Trauma and Injury Management (ITIM) is an institute within the Agency for Clinical Innovation (ACI). We oversee, coordinate and support the NSW trauma system.Trauma is the number one cause of death in people aged 0-45 years in NSW and is one of the top five causes of death for all age groups.We improve health outcomes for people who sustain traumatic injury.We do this by:providing leadership in the field of traumamonitoring and coordinating the NSW trauma systemsupporting clinicians working in the trauma system and others who contribute to injury prevention programs and trauma researchbeing a key facilitator of clinical care review, and monitoring together with education and researchraising awareness of trauma as a leading cause of deathproviding a central point of contact for all clinicians in NSW in relation to trauma.F﻿or more information, please visitInstitute of Trauma and Injury Management', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (376, 379, 'State Library of Queensland - Digital Inclusion', 'Wherever you are in Queensland, we''re empowering you to unlock the world of digital. Digital inclusion ensures that every Queenslander has opportunities to benefit from the digital economy through access to learning, entertainment, business, employment, and vital services. Explore our free online digital tools and in-person workshops to learn, connect, and thrive.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (377, 380, 'Turning Point', 'Turning Point is a national treatment, research and education centre that provides leadership in the alcohol and drug, gambling and mental health sectors.Combining research with service innovation, surveillance, system enhancements, capacity building and specialist support, Turning Point is a recognised centre of excellence that assists services, communities and governments to respond to current and emerging issues.Turning Point is part of Eastern Health and is affiliated with Monash University.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (378, 381, 'Escuela Normal del Estado | Turno: Vespertino', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (379, 382, 'routeAgile LATAM', 'S﻿omos una empresa jovén e innovadora integrada por consultores especializados en metodologías ágiles. Nuestro objetivo principal es proveer soluciones integrales a personas y empresas desde nuestras 4 líneas de negocio:EDUCACIÓN - CONSULTORÍA - AGILE TOOLS - STAFFING AGILEr﻿outeAgile.com | Think Agile, Be AgileW﻿hastApp: +52 55 6319 9993', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (380, 383, 'Más Voces en Diseño México', 'QUIÉNES SOMOSEn el año de 2019 la iniciativa llega a nuestro país y se conforma la comunidad Más mujeres en UX MéxicoNuestro principal objetivo es poder generar redes de apoyo entre las diferentes participantes y visibilizar la presencia femenina en la disciplina.Para lograrlo, la comunidad realiza reuniones mensuales donde se presentan temáticas inspiradoras y técnicas, para promover el compartir experiencias y conocimientos entre las mujeres UXers.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (381, 384, 'ALPHA MEXICO', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (382, 385, 'Lupita Morales', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (383, 386, 'UCF College of Community Innovation and Education', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
