  (385, 388, 'TRN. Attend a Professional Hiring Event!', 'EMPLOYERS ARE HIRING AT OUR NATIONWIDE PROFESSIONAL HIRING EVENTS.Career Seekers join us for a great day of recruiting. Recruiters, Managers and HR Professionals are looking to fill open positions at hiring events nationwide. Register today and attend the next Career Recruiting Network Hiring Event!Call & Register Today! 844-544-JOBS (5627)', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (386, 389, 'Assuring Better Child Health & Development', 'ABCD is a locally known and nationally recognized leader in co-designing, actively shaping, and championing progressive early childhood policies and equitable access to comprehensive, high quality perinatal and early childhood developmental services for young children and their families. Our mission is to partner with and build connections across healthcare, community agencies, and early childhood systems to expand best practices.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (387, 390, 'Tablon Partners', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (388, 391, 'Blockchain School', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (389, 392, 'Knowledge Corner by Two Poles', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (390, 393, 'Saprea', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (391, 394, 'DATAYOO | FarmiSpace', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (392, 395, 'TrueMeet', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (393, 396, 'Live Baltimore', 'Live Baltimore loves city life! We are an independent, nonprofit organization committed to promoting the benefits of Baltimore City living. Each year, Live Baltimore provides thousands of individuals with information on the city’s 278 neighborhoods, rental living options, homebuying incentive programs, historic tax credits, and more. Live Baltimore envisions Baltimore as a growing and vibrant city that attracts and retains a diverse population.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (394, 397, 'Egality Health', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (395, 398, 'The Lotus & the Light Metaphysical Center', 'The Lotus and the Light Metaphysical Center is a Holistic Wellness and Spiritual community located close to old town Manassas, VA. We offer an array of classes and workshops in metaphysical and spiritual development.Uma Alexandra Beepat is the CEO and owner of The Lotus and The Light and the main spiritual teacher at the center. Uma provides holistic wellness consultations, soul alignment coaching and intuitive readings to help clients connect to their path, live healthier and better and create more peace, joy and happiness in their lives. You can contact her for a free holistic wellness consultation anytime!Uma also offers an annual intuitive development program for the newly awakened and budding Intuitives who seek to trust their intuition and live a life of purpose.Come join this fun and light hearted group as we grow together spiritually and in friendship!Our meetings occur at our center on Mosby street close to Old Town Manassas. You can find out more about services and classes at www.thelotusandthelight.comWe look forward to meeting you one day,The Lotus and The LIght', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (396, 399, 'PPSC Learning Lab', 'PPSC''s Learning Lab offers cutting edge, affordable workshops focused on mental health education for counselors, teachers, parents, mental health and health professionals as well as the community at large.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (397, 400, 'VCCA2026', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (398, 401, 'Nimbus Intelligence powered by The Information Lab', 'Somos Nimbus Intelligence. Tu socio en innovación que puede ayudarte a superar tus objetivos de datos en la nube.Nimbus Intelligence representa el poder de los datos. A través de los esfuerzos de nuestros ingenieros certificados, apoyamos a tu empresa en el camino hacia la toma de decisiones basada en datos. Ya sea optimizando márgenes de beneficio, procesando datos de pacientes o simplificando cadenas de suministro, brindamos soluciones adaptadas a los requisitos de tu negocio. Te ayudamos a navegar a través de grandes volúmenes de datos, traduciéndolos en resultados útiles y concretos. Además, te capacitamos para tomar decisiones seguras dentro de tu área de experiencia, independientemente del sector.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (399, 402, 'in-mocion', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (400, 403, 'Arxivística i Gestió de Documents UAB', 'Arxivística i Gestió de Documents UAB, de l''Escola FUAB Formació. centre especialitzat en el camp de l''arxivística i la gestió de documents, es proposa assolir un ampli reconeixement acadèmic, professional i social a nivell nacional i internacional mitjançant la transmissió dels coneixements, l’ajut al desenvolupament de les competències i les habilitats inherents a l''especialitat, i la recerca.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00');
INSERT INTO "public"."organizers" ("id", "user_id", "display_name", "description", "logo_url", "status", "review_note", "applied_at", "approved_at", "approved_by", "created_at") VALUES
  (401, 404, 'Eusko Jaurlaritza', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (402, 405, 'SMA Solar Academy - ES', 'Como uno de los especialistas líderes mundiales en tecnología de sistemas para aplicaciones fotovoltaicas, el Grupo SMA hoy en día cuenta con los requisitos previos para el suministro descentralizado de energía renovable del mañana. La gama de productos de SMA incluye una amplia variedad de inversores fotovoltaicos eficientes y soluciones integrales para plantas fotovoltaicas de toda clase de potencia, sistemas inteligentes para gestionar la energía y sistemas de baterías, así como soluciones completas para aplicaciones híbridas de energía fotovoltaica y diésel. La oferta se completa con servicios energéticos digitales y amplias prestaciones de servicio, entre las que se cuentan la gestión operativa y el mantenimiento de centrales fotovoltaicas. Los inversores de SMA, con una potencia total de alrededor de 80 GW, se utilizan en más de 190 países de todo el mundo. Las innovaciones tecnológicas de SMA, premiadas en varias ocasiones, están amparadas por más de 1500 patentes y modelos registrados. Desde el año 2008, la empresa matriz del Grupo, SMA Solar Technology AG, cotiza en el Prime Standard de la Bolsa de Fráncfort (S92) y también en el índice SDAX.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (403, 406, 'Rinova Málaga', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (404, 407, 'PMI Galicia Spain Chapter', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (405, 408, 'Prevenció i Seguretat Integral UAB', 'Prevenció i Seguretat Integral (EPSI), de l''Escola FUAB Formació, i ubicada al campus de Bellaterra, ofereix estudis universitaris en l’àmbit de la prevenció i la seguretat integral.', NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
  (406, 409, 'Som Connexió', NULL, NULL, 'approved', 'Verified Organizer', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-19 03:30:16.651188+00', 1, '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00'),
