  (125, 'space-the-final-frontier-117-125', 137, 7, 'Space: The Final Frontier', NULL, 'The InDesign User Group is where folks who use InDesign hang out with other folks who use InDesign. We provide an authentic user-to-user experience where individuals who speak the language of page layout and digital publishing get together to let their pixels down.Major sponsors of IDUG include Adobe Systems and CreativePro Network, however, IDUG is an independent organization managed by local volunteers. IDUG is a registered 501(c)(3) not-for-profit organization financed through the sale of event tickets, the purchase of branded items and tax-deductible contributions. All regular IDUG meetings and events are free to the public.Privacy PolicyYour registration constitutes permission to use photos and audio/video recordings taken of you at the event or program for promotional and educational purposes in connection with IDUG programs and activities and on IDUG website and social media sites.', 'all', 'Mọi lứa tuổi', 120, '{"Kinh doanh"}', '{"Ban tổ chức"}', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dutskr8jo/image/upload/v1785426466/tixhub/events/EVT000119.jpg', NULL, 'Chính sách hoàn tiền của ban tổ chức.', 'f', 'general_admission', 'on_sale', 'approved', NULL, 'Space: The Final Frontier | TixHub', 'The InDesign User Group is where folks who use InDesign hang out with other folks who use InDesign. ...', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', 'Kinh doanh'),
