  (164, 'nature-made-understanding-and-adopting-bio-based-and-natural-materials-156-164', 165, 9, 'Nature-Made: Understanding and Adopting Bio-Based and Natural Materials', NULL, 'USGBC-CA is about peopleWe’re a member-based, non-profit organization representing green building and sustainability professionals in California. We are passionate, practical, and informed advocates who work together to transform California’s built environment into a more sustainable, resilient, and equitable region for all.Join our diverse community of developers, builders, owners, facility managers, architects, engineers, planners, technologists, green financiers, students of sustainability, green building experts, and advocates! With over 100 annual events, 13 training categories, and 14 programs, you’ve found your home for accelerating sustainability in California.Click here to support our small non-profit!Want to stay in the know?Click here to be sure you''ll never miss an upcoming event from USGBC-CA!', 'all', 'Mọi lứa tuổi', 120, '{"Công nghệ"}', '{"Ban tổ chức"}', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dutskr8jo/image/upload/v1785426472/tixhub/events/EVT000158.jpg', NULL, 'Chính sách hoàn tiền của ban tổ chức.', 'f', 'general_admission', 'on_sale', 'approved', NULL, 'Nature-Made: Understanding and Adopting Bio-Based and Natural Materials | TixHub', 'USGBC-CA is about peopleWe’re a member-based, non-profit organization representing green building an...', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', 'Công nghệ'),
