  (180, 'entrepreneurship-expo-pivot-profit-power-172-180', 181, 7, 'Entrepreneurship Expo: Pivot. Profit. Power.', NULL, 'Since its founding in 1913 Delta Sigma Theta has clearly distinguished itself as a public service organization that boldly confronts the challenges of African Americans and, hence, all Americans. Over the years, a wide range of programs addressing education, health, international development, and strengthening of the African American family have evolved. In realizing its mission, Delta Sigma Theta provides an extensive array of public service initiatives through its Five-Point Program Thrust of Economic Development, Educational Development, International Awareness and Involvement, Physical and Mental Health, and Political Awareness and Involvement.Since its chartering in February 1921, the Washington DC Alumnae Chapter (WDCAC) of Delta Sigma Theta Sorority, Inc., has mirrored its programs of community service in the distinguished image of its National organization, which in dramatic fashion, clearly confronts the challenges of African-Americans and their families. For more than 100 years, WDCAC has worked tirelessly to develop and implement a wide range of empowering programs and initiatives that emulate its shared mission with that of Delta Sigma Theta Sorority, Inc.', 'all', 'Mọi lứa tuổi', 120, '{"Kinh doanh"}', '{"Ban tổ chức"}', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dutskr8jo/image/upload/v1785426474/tixhub/events/EVT000174.jpg', NULL, 'Chính sách hoàn tiền của ban tổ chức.', 'f', 'general_admission', 'on_sale', 'approved', NULL, 'Entrepreneurship Expo: Pivot. Profit. Power. | TixHub', 'Since its founding in 1913 Delta Sigma Theta has clearly distinguished itself as a public service or...', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', 'Kinh doanh'),
