  (256, 'the-darkroom-chicago-date-night-workshop-in-logan-square-248-256', 254, 13, 'The Darkroom Chicago: Date Night Workshop in Logan Square', NULL, 'The Darkroom Chicago is a community darkroom and creative studio rooted in the art of film photography. We offer hands-on development workshops, immersive darkroom sessions, and unforgettable analog experiences designed for photographers of all levels—from first-timers to seasoned shooters. Whether you''re here to learn, connect, or create, this is where your story develops.', 'all', 'Mọi lứa tuổi', 120, '{Khác}', '{"Ban tổ chức"}', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dutskr8jo/image/upload/v1785426487/tixhub/events/EVT000251.jpg', NULL, 'Chính sách hoàn tiền của ban tổ chức.', 'f', 'general_admission', 'on_sale', 'approved', NULL, 'The Darkroom Chicago: Date Night Workshop in Logan Square | TixHub', 'The Darkroom Chicago is a community darkroom and creative studio rooted in the art of film photograp...', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', 'Khác'),
