  (367, 'silences-stories-scripts-mothers-and-and-daughters-in-literature-359-367', 359, 13, 'Silences, Stories, Scripts: Mothers and and Daughters in Literature', NULL, 'The Goldsmiths Research Centre for Comparative Literature (CCL) is an interdepartmental Centre drawing from the Department of English & Creative Writing (formerly English & Comparative Literature) and the Department of Theatre and Performance, with contributions and collaborations across Goldsmiths and beyond.Building on an established tradition of teaching and researching literary, visual, cultural and performance texts from all areas of the world and in many different languages, the CCL aims to foster innovative research in and on the theory, practice and history of comparative literature, world literature(s) and theatre, reception of the classics, multilingualism and translation, intercultural theatre, and creative writing.', 'all', 'Mọi lứa tuổi', 120, '{Khác}', '{"Ban tổ chức"}', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dutskr8jo/image/upload/v1785426510/tixhub/events/EVT000368.jpg', NULL, 'Chính sách hoàn tiền của ban tổ chức.', 'f', 'general_admission', 'on_sale', 'approved', NULL, 'Silences, Stories, Scripts: Mothers and and Daughters in Literature | TixHub', 'The Goldsmiths Research Centre for Comparative Literature (CCL) is an interdepartmental Centre drawi...', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', '2026-05-18 03:30:16.651188+00', 'Khác'),
