  (702, 'adorehim-movie-723-702', 4, 14, 'Adore Him', 'Adore Him', 'ADORE HIM: He is here is a docudrama that invites you to enter the very presence of God. From executive producer Deacon Steve Greco (Jesus Thirsts: The Miracle of the Eucharist) and writer, producer, director Don Johnson, ADORE HIM will be released in U.S. theaters Oct. 4 - 8. Through cinematic reenactments that span salvation history and intimate modern-day interviews from around the world, this film explores the transforming power of meeting the Creator of the Universe face to face. From encountering the Ark of the Covenant as it traveled across the wilderness to bumping into Jesus as he taught in the marketplace, this story builds to a culmination in the Eucharist, and today millions are finding out how much God truly loves them as they adore Him in the Blessed Sacrament. He is here. Will you come?', 'all', 'Certificate: Unrated / All Ages', 120, '{Documentary,Drama}', '{"Director: Donald J. Johnson","Đạo diễn: Donald J. Johnson","Writers: Donald J. Johnson","Adele Anaya","Mike Aquilina","Alex Bilbrey"}', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dutskr8jo/image/upload/v1786852178/tixhub/events/702/banner/702.jpg', NULL, 'Chính sách hoàn/hủy vé rạp theo quy định của nhà phát hành phim và đối tác chiếu phim.', 'f', 'seated', 'on_sale', 'approved', 'Merged and consolidated from sources: imdb', 'Adore Him (2026) | TixHub Movies', 'ADORE HIM: He is here is a docudrama that invites you to enter the very presence of God. From executive producer Deacon Steve Greco (Jesus Thirsts: The Mir...', '2026-08-15 00:00:00+00', '2026-08-15 00:00:00+00', 'Phim'),
